            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Riduci <code>salary</code> di 500 solo se è maggiore di 2100.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sottrai <code>500</code> solo dagli stipendi superiori a <code>2100</code>. Restituisci lo stipendio anche se non cambia.</p><p>Chiama la funzione con <code>2100</code> affinché il reddito visualizzato rimanga <code>2100</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return income;\" /></content></option></options></interactio